+To check whether a connected account has enabled MobilePay, inspect `capabilities.mobilepay_payments` in the [Accounts API or webhooks](https://docs.stripe.com/api/accounts/object.md#account_object-capabilities-mobilepay_payments) and confirm that it’s `active`. For connected accounts without full Stripe Dashboard access, request the `mobilepay_payments` capability using the [Capabilities API](https://docs.stripe.com/api/capabilities.md). Learn more about [enabling payment methods for connected accounts](https://docs.stripe.com/connect/account-capabilities.md).
